Backend: CUDA (wake engine + fuselage source field + dense panel solve) [forced by CLI]
Case: V-10.30_alpha-6.0_RPMs-6700-5754-3705, rotors=3
  [te kutta] constraint-row closure (default). The loads come from the panel solve,
             but the circulation LEVEL is imposed from the previous step and seeded
             once from the blade-element estimate 0.5*W*c*Cl, so it reproduces that
             seed for the whole run and the Cl/Cd tables are REQUIRED. Set
             'Trailing edge closure = pressure' (or = wake) to remove that
             dependency; neither is validated in level on a rotor yet.
